   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Edward had a series of strokes and hopes to recover over the next several months. Currently, he needs constant medical supervision and is unable to walk or do basic tasks such as feed and bathe himself. He has no resources to obtain this level of assistance at home. What type of housing option would best fit Edward’s needs?",
